WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.789 --> 00:00:13.009
Hey youtubers it’s charlie, welcome to my
game of thrones season 4 preview for Varys.

00:00:13.009 --> 00:00:17.220
If you’ve seen my other previews you know
I’m picking some of our favorite characters

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:19.669
big and small and talking about what they’ll
be doing in season 4.

00:00:19.669 --> 00:00:25.019
As always, spoilers for everything in seasons
1 through 3, and partial spoilers for books

00:00:25.019 --> 00:00:26.019
4 and 5.

00:00:26.019 --> 00:00:29.399
I really feel like Game of Thrones the tv
show kind of buries the lead, but Varys is

00:00:29.399 --> 00:00:32.419
the spider of Kings Landing.

00:00:32.419 --> 00:00:35.589
Like Pycelle, he appears really non-threatening
but in the creepiest possible ways.

00:00:35.589 --> 00:00:44.010
But during season 3 we actually learned that
Varys is all about the long con.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:48.790
So lets talk about what his true goal is,
what he’s going to do about it in season

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:50.449
4 and what his motivations are.

00:00:50.449 --> 00:00:53.369
Number 1: Varys is trying to restore the Targaryen’s
to the Throne.

00:00:53.369 --> 00:01:03.940
We learned this in season 1 when arya caught
him plotting with Illyrio.

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:07.040
Why?

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:09.960
He is extremely well read and has learned
about the dangers of the white walkers and

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:10.960
the great other.

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:13.810
He really does want Westeros to survive and
they can only do it united.

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:26.400
So the war of the 5 kings has to end and he
feels like someone from the Targaryen Bloodline

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:28.070
is the best person to lead them.

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:33.270
Dany is obviously at the top of that list,
but there are a few other worthy bastards

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:37.640
like Gendry and Jon Snow who look like they
have leadership potential.

00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:41.460
I’ll talk more about the other contenders
for the throne later.

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:47.340
Number 2: During Season 4, Varys is going
to take steps to eliminate threats to his

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:48.420
vision of a Targaryen restoration.

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:53.070
Since he’s the spider of westeros, you’ll
never see vary’s carve someone up or crossbow

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:54.070
them to death.

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:57.680
Varys real skill is in creating the circumstances
for his plans to unfold without having to

00:01:57.680 --> 00:01:58.680
really do anything.

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:01.530
So other characters will do things that get
rid of contenders for the throne.

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:06.860
Recently George RR Martin talked about the
Purple Wedding in an interview and while I

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:09.799
don’t want to spoil it too much, Varys basically
enables everything that happens during it

00:02:09.799 --> 00:02:11.090
and helps during the aftermath.

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:13.980
For people that have read the books and know
what’s happening already, think about it

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:14.980
this way.

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:16.560
Varys already knows everything that happened
and who was responsible, but because he’s

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:21.799
trying to restore the targaryens he kind of
lets things happen in a roundabout way so

00:02:21.799 --> 00:02:26.150
that two birds are killed with one stone.

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:28.140
Well it’s not a stone that does the job,
but you get the idea.

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:30.420
(b/w)
Number 3: Why is he doing all of this?

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:33.810
He’s from the eastern kingdoms so he’s
not trying to avenge his bloodline and he’s

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:35.849
not in love with any of the ruling houses.

00:02:35.849 --> 00:02:40.840
And I’ll even go so far as to say that even
though he’s trying to restore them, he’s

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:43.430
not in love with any of the targaryens.

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:47.549
His real motivation is that he hates magic
of any kind.

00:02:47.549 --> 00:02:52.849
In that season 3 scene with tyrion where he
talks about patience and revenge he explains

00:02:52.849 --> 00:02:54.230
exactly why he hates magic.

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:56.219
Because he understands what a threat it is.

00:02:56.219 --> 00:03:00.139
Under normal circumstances he was able to
grow his influence in the really classic sense

00:03:00.139 --> 00:03:01.139
of the American Dream.

00:03:01.139 --> 00:03:05.459
But if say a magical army of zombies were
to take over the world.

00:03:05.459 --> 00:03:11.280
Everyone would die.

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:16.739
So for Vary’s is more about the devil you
know.

00:03:16.739 --> 00:03:21.939
Originally he had intended for Dany’s older
brother Rhaegar to take the throne and based

00:03:21.939 --> 00:03:26.239
on what the books have told us about him,
he would have been the great leader Varys

00:03:26.239 --> 00:03:27.239
had wanted.

00:03:27.239 --> 00:03:32.249
But like everything on game of thrones, his
plans went to shit when Aerys killed Rickard

00:03:32.249 --> 00:03:35.519
and Brandon stark and the rest of the great
houses joined Robert’s rebellion.

00:03:35.519 --> 00:03:38.699
It wasn’t really Rhaegar kidnapping Lyanna,
if that’s actually what happened (there

00:03:38.699 --> 00:03:41.590
are rumors that there was something else going
on there.

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:42.730
like a lovechild name snow).

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:46.629
It was really the murder of the starks that
dumped the gasoline on the fire.

00:03:46.629 --> 00:03:56.370
So now that we know Varys is going to be taking
some more direct steps to restore Dany to

00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:59.999
the throne in season 4 let me know what you
think he’ll end up doing.

00:03:59.999 --> 00:04:05.139
Is he going to try and have Littlefinger killed?

00:04:05.139 --> 00:04:07.319
